Package: kali-ai-native-shell
Version: 0.1.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kali-ai-native-core, nodejs, npm, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Maintainer: AI-native Kali project <maintainer@example.invalid>
Description: AI-native Kali - Hermes desktop shell as the native session
 Installs Hermes Desktop as the Wayland/X session itself rather than as an
 application: taskbar, launcher, notification centre, file manager and the
 native Kanban surfaces (taskbar widget, desktop overlay, card drawer).
 .
 Registers /usr/share/wayland-sessions/hermes-shell.desktop so the display
 manager offers "Hermes AI Desktop" at login.
